  <data name="Help_Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>SandForge — disposable Windows environment manager.

Usage:
  sandforge doctor
  sandforge run &lt;file&gt; [--template &lt;path&gt;]
  sandforge run-script &lt;file&gt; [--template &lt;path&gt;]
  sandforge test-installer &lt;file&gt; [--template &lt;path&gt;]
  sandforge matrix run &lt;file&gt; --templates &lt;name1,name2&gt; [--parallel 2]
  sandforge session list|show|delete [id]
  sandforge report &lt;id&gt; [--format console|json|html]
  sandforge recover
  sandforge cleanup [--dry-run] [--older-than 30d] [--orphaned]
  sandforge cache list
  sandforge cache clean [type] [--dry-run]
  sandforge update check
  sandforge update install [--yes]
  sandforge update auto on|off [--apply]
  sandforge update channel stable|preview

Running without arguments opens the interactive TUI.
SchemaVersion 2 templates support extends/includes, provisioning and managed cache.</value></data>
